	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/plain" rect="(11.28571428571422, 2.428571428571445, 605.0, 408.0)" font-family="Segoe UI" font-size="16">import data mtcars.csv and Column Statistics
change datatype of am, gear, carb,vs,cyl into categiorical
Distrubutions of - mpg, wt, hp, drat, am, cyl
Pivot Table of following -
- Average mpg by am
- Median hp by cyl
- Median wt by gear
- Average drat by carb

Test Null Average mpg of different am identical
Test Null Average wt of different am identical
Test Null Average mpg of different cyl identical
Test Null Average hp of different carb identical
Test Null No Association between am and carb
Test Null No Association between carb and gear

Build Multiple Linear Regression model with mpg as Target Variable and all other variables as Independent variables. Identify R Square and RMSE.</text>
		<text id="1" type="text/plain" rect="(20.0, 795.7142857142858, 142.14285714285714, 166.0)" font-family="Segoe UI" font-size="16">Distributions - Numeric Variable - Bell Curve 
Non Numeric or Categorical Variable - Frequency</text>
		<text id="2" type="text/plain" rect="(410.7142857142857, 428.57142857142856, 213.5714285714286, 145.71428571428578)" font-family="Segoe UI" font-size="16">Pivot Table 
Rows - Categorical Variable
Columns - Same as Rows
Values - Numerical Variable
Aggregations - Mean/Median/Sum</text>
		<text id="3" type="text/plain" rect="(423.57142857142867, 577.857142857143, 215.71428571428567, 100.0)" font-family="Segoe UI" font-size="16">For All Hypothesis Test Box Plot Widget is Used. 2 Sample T test, ANOVA, ChiSquare Test.

Interpretation -
p less than 0.05 - REJECT NULL
p greater than 0.05 - FAIL to REJECT NULL(ACCEPT)</text>
		<text id="4" type="text/plain" rect="(248.57142857142858, 1175.0, 185.7142857142857, 29.28571428571422)" font-family="Segoe UI" font-size="16">R Square - 0.341
RMSE - 4.815</text>
	</annotations>
